<mxfile host="drawio" type="device" pages="1"><diagram id="sd4" name="SD-4"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1200" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1749" pageHeight="1414" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="v1" value="&lt;b&gt;Aflami: sequence diagram 4 of 4, permission check on any request (SD-4)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;How PermissionGuard.canAct decides before any service reads or changes a project&#x27;s data, for every action in SD-1 to SD-3 and the rest of Aflami.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="18" width="1669" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v2" value="Signed-in user&lt;br&gt;or visitor" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="125" y="82" width="26" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;«Next.js»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:Web app&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="307" y="96" width="110" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v4" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;«service» any module&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:ApplicationService, :TaskService …&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="501" y="96" width="238" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v5" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;«service» Shared&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:PermissionGuard&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1114" y="96" width="132" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v6" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;«PostgreSQL»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;:Database&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="96" width="100" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v7" value="alt" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;width=40;height=20;boundedLbl=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="350" width="1049" height="402" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v8" value="[the rule is Public: a published film page, or an Open call&#x27;s link]" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="716" y="352" width="400" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="660" y="426" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1709" y="426" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v10" value="[any other rule, and no actor: a visitor]" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="716" y="428" width="300" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="660" y="502" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1709" y="502" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v12" value="[any other rule, and a signed-in actor]" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="716" y="504" width="300" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v13" value="opt" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;width=40;height=20;boundedLbl=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="596" width="759" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v14" value="[the rule names the Screenwriter]" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="974" y="598" width="196" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15" value="alt" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;width=40;height=20;boundedLbl=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="808" width="1649" height="296" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v16" value="[refused]" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="810" width="120" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e17" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="60" y="900" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1709" y="900" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v18" value="[allowed]" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="904" width="120" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e19" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="138" y="146" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="138" y="1134" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e20" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="362" y="146" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="362" y="1134" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e21" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="620" y="146" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="620" y="1134" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e22" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1180" y="146" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1180" y="1134" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e23" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1650" y="146" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1650" y="1134" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v24" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="356" y="198" width="12" height="882" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v25" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="614" y="232" width="12" height="814" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v26" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1174" y="266" width="12" height="516" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v27" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1644" y="532" width="12" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v28" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1644" y="628" width="12" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v29" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1644" y="978" width="12" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e30" value="1. Choose an action in a project: Approve, Publish, Open the script …" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="138" y="198" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="356" y="198" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e31" value="2. method(record, actor); the API takes the actor from the session, and a visitor has none" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="368" y="232" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="614" y="232" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e32" value="3. canAct(actor, project, action)" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="626" y="266" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1174" y="266" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e33" value="" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1186" y="300" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1192" y="318" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1216" y="300"/><mxPoint x="1216" y="318"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v34" value="4. find the action&#x27;s rule in the table below; no rule: refused (DD-03)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="300" width="420" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e35" value="" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1186" y="380" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1192" y="398" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1216" y="380"/><mxPoint x="1216" y="398"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v36" value="5. allowed if the project is Published, or the call is Open; no sign-in needed" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="380" width="440" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e37" value="" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1186" y="456" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1192" y="474" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1216" y="456"/><mxPoint x="1216" y="474"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v38" value="6. refused: sign in first" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="456" width="160" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e39" value="7. find membership (actor, project): the only place a permission is kept" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1186" y="532" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1644" y="532" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e40" value="8. permission and status, or none" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=open;endSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1644" y="566" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1186" y="566" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e41" value="9. find the membership&#x27;s film roles" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1186" y="628" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1644" y="628" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e42" value="10. film roles" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=open;endSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1644" y="662" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1186" y="662" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e43" value="" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1186" y="706" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1192" y="724" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1216" y="706"/><mxPoint x="1216" y="724"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v44" value="11. compare with the rule: ACTIVE, and a permission or film role that the rule allows" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="706" width="500" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e45" value="12. allowed or refused" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=open;endSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1174" y="782" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="626" y="782" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e46" value="13. refused: nothing is read or changed" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=open;endSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="614" y="840" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="368" y="840" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e47" value="14. show why: sign in, not in this team, or &quot;only the owner can publish&quot;" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=open;endSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="356" y="874" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="138" y="874" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e48" value="" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="626" y="930" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="632" y="948" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="656" y="930"/><mxPoint x="656" y="948"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v49" value="15. check the record: its state allows this step (DD-22); for start or finish, the actor owns the task; if not, refused as in 13" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacing=0;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="930" width="640" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e50" value="16. read or change it, in one transaction" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="626" y="978" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1644" y="978" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e51" value="17. result" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=open;endSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1644" y="1012" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="626" y="1012" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e52" value="18. result" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=open;endSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="614" y="1046" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="368" y="1046" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e53" value="19. show the result" style="html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=open;endSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="356" y="1080" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="138" y="1080" as="targetPoint"/><mxPoint x="0" y="-10" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v54" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules in the guard&lt;/b&gt;, from the lowest level up; an action that no rule names is refused (DD-03). &lt;b&gt;Public&lt;/b&gt;, no account: open a published film page or an Open casting call&#x27;s link (FR-FILM-02). &lt;b&gt;Creator&lt;/b&gt;, signed in: apply to an Open call (UC-05); rate a published film, unless they are on its team (UC-14, Should). &lt;b&gt;Member&lt;/b&gt;, ACTIVE: open the project, its team, tasks and credits; open the script through a link that expires (NFR-PRV-01, NFR-SEC-05); start and finish their own tasks; attach files. &lt;b&gt;Screenwriter&lt;/b&gt; (an ACTIVE member with that film role), Manager or Owner: upload the script (FR-PRJ-04). &lt;b&gt;Manager or Owner&lt;/b&gt;: casting calls; applications, which only they see (NFR-PRV-05); invitations; tasks; credits; the film details; announcements; the activity log. &lt;b&gt;Owner only&lt;/b&gt;: publish, hide and show the film page (FR-FILM-03), and give or remove manager rights (FR-ACC-03)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#BDB76B;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1158" width="1669" height="61.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v55" value="&lt;b&gt;Where a permission comes from.&lt;/b&gt; Only from memberships: &lt;i&gt;projects.created_by&lt;/i&gt; records who created the project, for history, and the guard never reads it, so the two can never disagree. A LEFT membership counts as none. canAct receives the project, not the record, so the service then checks the record itself (step 15). Every rule has an automated test as a visitor, a member, a manager and the owner, run on every pull request (NFR-MNT-01).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Covers&lt;/b&gt; FR-ACC-02, FR-ACC-03, FR-PRJ-04, FR-FILM-02, FR-FILM-03, NFR-PRV-01, NFR-PRV-05, NFR-SEC-05, NFR-MNT-01; UC-22, which UC-03, UC-04, UC-06, UC-07, UC-08, UC-10, UC-11, UC-15 and UC-16 include; DD-03, DD-21, DD-22." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#BDB76B;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1231.6" width="1669" height="61.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v56" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Time runs from top to bottom. A box at the top is a participant: &lt;i&gt;:PermissionGuard&lt;/i&gt; means an object of that class from the class diagrams, coloured by its module (grey Shared; white for the web app, the database and a service from any module). The dashed line under it is its lifeline, and the thin bar shows when it is busy. A solid arrow with a filled head is a call, written as the method and its arguments; a dashed arrow with an open head is the answer. A frame groups messages: &lt;b&gt;alt&lt;/b&gt; runs only the part whose [condition] holds (dashed lines separate the parts), and &lt;b&gt;opt&lt;/b&gt; runs only if its condition holds. SD-1 to SD-3 call canAct with their own actions: &quot;accept&quot;, &quot;create task&quot;, &quot;approve credits&quot;, &quot;publish&quot;." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BBBBBB;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1307.2" width="1669" height="77.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>